    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I am put under a curse."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I know you want to help me,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "but your experience is not enough."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I am not in the good condition,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "so what I can do for you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "is just like this."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Then, good bye."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Take care~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Hi~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "You are an adventurer like me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Well... In fact, I am"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "put under a strange curse."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "To release this curse,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "somebody needs to do ^800080Oath-taking ceremony^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "with me,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "and then needs to solve"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "several problems instead of me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Let's help ^800080Rina^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Just skip it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "To help me,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I need a competent adventurer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "If you know those people,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I hope you to introduce them to me later."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Are you really going to help me?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "You are so brave."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Then I'll start ^800080Oath-taking ceremony^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^787878( A mysterious atmosphere hangs in the air. )^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Blah blah blah..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Blah blah blah..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^787878( ... This is a strange spell. )^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Haaaaah~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^800080Oath-taking ceremony^000000 is done enough now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Isn't that so simple?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Okay, from no on,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "you need to go on ^006400a real adventure"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "to release my curse^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Let me know when you are ready."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "What you need to do is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "to choose one monster among"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^FF0000DEVIRUCHI,^000000 ^FF0000WRAITH DEAD,^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^FF0000DULLAHAN,^000000 ^FF0000NIGHTMARE TERROR^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "and then kill ^0000FF50^000000 monsters"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "and come back to me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "It must be a tough task,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "but you are the right person"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "who did the oath-taking ceremony."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I hope you succeed."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "You did it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I can feel that my body is recovering."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "But it is not enough."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^006400You have one more thing to do.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Let me know when you're ready."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I will check one thing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "For this task,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "You need to feel the music."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "You cannot complete the task"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "without the music."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "do you have any problem?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "- Check! -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^787878- BGM option should be turned on -^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^787878- in the game option menu. -^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^787878- Please check -^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^787878- whether you can listen -^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^787878- to the music sound. -^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[I'm ready to listen to the BGM.]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[I can't listen to the BGM.]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I am so shocked that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "you cannot feel the music."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "What should we do now..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Listen carefully"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "the feelings of it..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I can't hear it,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "but you can hear the sound."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "^006400The music you're hearing now^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "has something to do with the one specific city."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Think carefully ^006400what kind of city^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "has similar feeling with this music."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "And..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Go to ^006400the city"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "where you can remind by this music^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 209,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "After that,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "find ^FF0000the strange mark^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "around the entrances of the city."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Then you can release the curse on me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 215,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "It must be tough"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 216,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "but I hope you good luck."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 225,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "You're back~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "My curse has been released."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Your bag is too full."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 232,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I have a present for you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "so make your bag lighter."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I'll wait for you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 265,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "This is the present for you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "It's not a big one"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 268,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "but please take it"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 269,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "as a token of my gratitude."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I'll take a rest for a few days"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "and then I'll go on an adventure."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "See you again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 284,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "[Rina]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 285,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Thank you for releasing my curse."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 286,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "I'll take a rest for a few days"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 287,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "and then go on an adventure again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 288,
      "npc" : "Rina",
      "text" : "Have a happy day~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 302,
      "text" : "- I found ^0000FFthe strange mark^000000. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 305,
      "text" : "- I can definitely feel that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
